  "The liver detoxifies harmful substances in our blood": "body: liver, heart",
  "Eating colourful vegetables gives diverse phytonutrients": "carrot; broccoli right carrot; tomato right broccoli; corncob right tomato",
  "A healthy digestive system gives us continuous energy": "boy/jump",
