  // --- Science · Grade 4 · Sound ------------------------------------------
  "Sound is produced when objects vibrate back and forth": "tuning fork; sound right tuning fork",
  "Plucking a guitar string makes it vibrate and sing": "guitar",
  "Striking a drum skin harder makes a louder sound": "drum; sound right drum",
  "A ringing brass bell vibrates when struck by its clapper": "bell; sound right bell",
  "Our voice is made by vibrating vocal cords in the throat": "girl/sing",
